iew\tWritten per person, edited by us\tNone\tSkipped\tA sample, if you ask\nTuned\tWeekly, on results\tBy hand, when there's time\tQuarterly\tIn a monthly report\nWhat you pay for\tOne build fee, one retainer, tools included. Every lead, domain and workflow stays yours.\tTools, data and your hours\tSalary, ramp and tools\tA retainer, plus your tools\nNOT FOR YOU IF\nYou want volume for its own sake.\nYou need pipeline this fortnight.\nNobody on your side can take a sales call.\nYou want a dashboard rather than a decision.\nBEFORE YOU ASK\nWhat does it cost?\nWho writes the emails, and do I approve every send?\nHow long before the first meeting is booked?\nWill this hurt our domain or brand?\nWho owns the data and the domains?\nCan you run just one channel?\nBe seen.\nBe chosen.\nBuilt once. Tuned every week.\nBook a call\nGet your free distribution plan\n30 minutes · no pitch\nSOURCES1 Reply rate, first month of sending (Replies over 300 contacts, 12 Aug to 12 Sep 2026. Campaign report) · As of 25 September 2026\nProduct views use a demo workspace with fictional companies. Client figures are marked Real and link to their source.\nWe fix distribution for B2B companies.\nBook a call\nMálaga, Spain · Europe and the UAE\nWHAT WE DO\nGTM Engine\nPaid Acquisition\nConversion\nFree distribution plan\nWHO IT'S FOR\nRecruitment agencies\nMarketing & creative agencies\nLogistics & freight companies\nB2B SaaS companies\nB2B companies\nCOMPANY\nResults\nAbout\nBlog\nContact\nClient login\nELSEWHERE\nLinkedIn\nInstagram\nWhatsApp\nmagnus@clearscaler.com\n© 2026 ClearScaler\nPrivacy\nCookies\nCookie settings\nPause animations",
